WEBVTT

00:02:57.965 --> 00:03:01.344
And we step forward,
and I realize there’s no floor.

00:03:01.385 --> 00:03:02.678
It's a modest home.

00:03:03.596 --> 00:03:06.766
It's one room with a couch on the side

00:03:06.807 --> 00:03:09.435
that pulls out into the bed
that they sleep on.

00:03:09.435 --> 00:03:11.354
There's a wood fire oven in the middle

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:14.440
that heats the room
and that they cook with.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.651
And at three years old, I was concerned.

00:03:16.651 --> 00:03:20.321
So I go to grab Lailaa,
but I was too late.

00:03:21.197 --> 00:03:24.575
She looked in the corner
and she said, “A dollhouse!”

00:03:24.575 --> 00:03:28.204
And Masha and Lailaa ran to the corner
to play with the dollhouse.

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:30.289
I'm so proud that that's my kid,